.env

# Compiled binaries — `go build` drops one named after the module.
mailtea-go-example
*.exe
*.test

# Written by `go mod tidy` on first build; the one dependency is the Mailtea
# SDK, resolved from its module path.
go.sum

# A local override pointing the SDK at a checkout on this machine. Paths in it
# exist nowhere else.
go.work
go.work.sum
